1
00:00:00,486 --> 00:00:01,960
Anyone who mistreats
Hong Il-tak

2
00:00:02,339 --> 00:00:04,155
or calls him a girl
is dead

3
00:00:05,604 --> 00:00:07,610
Let's stop the crap
between guys

4
00:00:09,117 --> 00:00:10,197
Especially you
Kim Hyeong-ju

5
00:00:10,469 --> 00:00:11,469
Hey, Hyeong-ju

6
00:00:12,679 --> 00:00:13,679
-Hyeon-wu
-What?

7
00:00:14,739 --> 00:00:15,819
You got a problem
with that?

8
00:00:17,059 --> 00:00:19,274
A lot has changed
after that day

9
00:00:25,268 --> 00:00:27,548
No one's bothered me
for a week

10
00:00:27,631 --> 00:00:28,911
Brute strength
really is the best

11
00:00:28,944 --> 00:00:31,447
Usually, there are
a few jerks around

12
00:00:33,217 --> 00:00:35,395
Lee Hyeon-wu
got rid of them for me

13
00:00:35,478 --> 00:00:36,667
I feel at ease

14
00:00:53,428 --> 00:00:54,460
Ugh, seriously

15
00:00:54,876 --> 00:00:56,034
What is up with him?

16
00:00:56,622 --> 00:00:58,100
This is so awkward

17
00:01:00,018 --> 00:01:01,018
He smiled

18
00:01:04,657 --> 00:01:06,868
Yes, that's
the biggest problem

19
00:01:07,322 --> 00:01:10,429
I think Lee Hyeon-wu
likes me

20
00:01:10,512 --> 00:01:12,214
Even though I'm a guy

21
00:01:12,698 --> 00:01:15,034
That's why
he defended me

22
00:01:15,117 --> 00:01:16,620
Anyone who mistreats
Hong Il-tak

23
00:01:16,703 --> 00:01:18,683
or calls him a girl
is dead

24
00:01:20,372 --> 00:01:21,957
I need to walk
a fine line

25
00:01:22,347 --> 00:01:24,168
so he doesn't
get more serious

26
00:01:24,251 --> 00:01:24,958
Il-tak

27
00:01:25,041 --> 00:01:26,104
What are you doing
after school?

28
00:01:26,128 --> 00:01:27,128
Here it is

29
00:01:27,656 --> 00:01:31,036
I'd think he wants
to hang out

30
00:01:31,119 --> 00:01:33,572
but is this b******
actually…

31
00:01:33,969 --> 00:01:35,471
We get out
an hour early today

32
00:01:35,554 --> 00:01:36,286
Wanna hang out?

33
00:01:36,369 --> 00:01:37,369
Don't tell me…

34
00:01:38,076 --> 00:01:39,076
Is he asking me out?

35
00:01:40,726 --> 00:01:42,407
Please don't smile
like that
